<view class="screen">
  <view class="page-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">ALARM HISTORY</view><view class="page-title">报警记录</view><view class="page-copy">真实 ALARM 帧进入统一运行时；护理演示和姿态角抖动不会生成这里的事件。</view></view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{active.length}}" class="active-card"><view class="active-kicker">ACTIVE DEVICE ALARM</view><view wx:for="{{active}}" wx:key="eventKey" class="active-item"><view class="active-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="active-copy">设备 {{item.deviceId}} · BOOT {{item.boot}} · ID {{item.id}}</view><view class="active-copy">{{item.acknowledged ? '已确认，本地提示已停止；等待固件 ACTIVE=0。' : '尚未确认，请优先确认佩戴者状态。'}}</view><view class="active-audio">{{alarmAudioStatus}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.resolveStatusText}}" class="active-copy">{{item.resolveStatusText}}</view><view class="button-row"><button class="alarm-button" data-key="{{item.eventKey}}" disabled="{{item.acknowledgeDisabled}}" bindtap="acknowledge">{{item.acknowledged ? '本地提示已停止' : '确认并停止本地提示'}}</button><button wx:if="{{role !== 'guardian'}}" class="resolve-button" data-key="{{item.eventKey}}" disabled="{{item.resolveDisabled}}" bindtap="requestResolve">{{item.resolveText}}</button></view></view></view>
  <view wx:else class="card empty-card"><view class="empty-state">当前没有活动报警。</view><view class="status-copy">{{guardianStatus}}</view></view>

  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">事件历史</view><view class="section-copy">同一设备/BOOT/ID 的重复帧只保留一条；云端普通回执不会把活动事件标记为固件已解除。</view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="empty-state">尚无真实报警事件。</view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="eventKey" class="history-item"><view class="history-head"><view class="history-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="history-status {{item.status === 'active' ? 'status-active' : 'status-resolved'}}">{{item.status === 'active' ? '活动中' : '已解除'}}</view></view><view class="history-copy">{{item.time}} · BOOT {{item.boot}} · ID {{item.id}}</view><view class="history-copy">{{item.acknowledged ? '已确认' : '未确认'}} · 来源 {{item.sourceText}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">监护边界</view><view class="section-copy">监护者可以确认并停止本机提示，但没有远程解除按钮；只有设备发送带对应 BOOT/ID 的 ACTIVE=0，运行时才结束事件。</view><button class="quiet-button full-button" bindtap="openGuardian">打开绑定与角色</button></view>
</view>
